<title>USA: Delta Air places ad account in review - NYT.</title>
<headline>Delta Air places ad account in review - NYT.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Delta Air Lines Inc said Tuesday it placed it's long-standing advertising account with BBDO Worldwide in review, The New York Times reported Wednesday.</p>
<p>The carrier has had the account, with billings estimated at $100 million, for 51 years with BBDO Worldwide in Atlanta and New York and their predecesssor firms, the newspaper said.</p>
<p>It quoted a company official saying the move is related to cost cutting efforts.</p>
